# Pillar N — TITLE (or # PRINCIPLE TITLE)

## Statement

One complete sentence that defines the ambition or operating principle.

## Explanation

One concise paragraph explaining why this matters and the governing idea behind it. Keep it meaningful and specific, without repeating every characteristic below.

## Characteristics

### First distinct characteristic

One sentence explaining what must be true for this characteristic.

A short, substantive explanation with practical implications, boundaries, examples or tradeoffs. This paragraph stays hidden until the reader expands the characteristic.

### Second distinct characteristic

One sentence explaining what must be true for the second characteristic.

The fuller explanation of this characteristic, with distinct detail that supports its headline rather than just repeating it.

## References

Optional links to the related canonical gaps, plans or evidence. Omit this entire section when there are no references.
